.page usleep 1 pause for some microseconds

# SYNOPSIS
*usleep* _MICROSECONDS_

# DESCRIPTION
`usleep` pauses for the given number of microseconds (a millionth of a second). The kernel clock ticks once per millisecond, so shorter pauses end up as about a millisecond.

# EXAMPLES
    usleep 500000

# SEE ALSO
sleep(1)
